category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libjsoncpp-devel libsasl2-devel libssl-devel libuv-devel python3-devel python312-build python312-cffi python312-pip python312-setuptools python312-wheel
sdesc: "High-performance, lightweight messaging library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Qpid Proton is a high-performance, lightweight messaging library. It can be
used in the widest range of messaging applications, including brokers, client
libraries, routers, bridges, proxies, and more. Proton makes it trivial to
integrate with the AMQP 1.0 ecosystem from any platform, environment, or
language."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/apache/qpid-proton/
license: Apache-2.0 AND BSL-1.0
